<title>USA: FINAL PRICING - Lee Cty Hsg, Fla., $11.900 mln.</title>
<headline>FINAL PRICING - Lee Cty Hsg, Fla., $11.900 mln.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Raymond James and Associates said it received the award for $11.900 million of Lee County Housing Finance Authority, Fla., single family mortgage revenue convertible option bonds, series 1997A.</p>
</text>
